<title>USA: V-ONE distribution deal projects $1 mln rev.</title>
<headline>V-ONE distribution deal projects $1 mln rev.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Md. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>V-ONE Corp said Wednesday Sea Change Corp agreed to distribute V-ONE's security product called SmartGate in Canada.</p>
<p>The agreement projects $1 million in SmartGate sales in the next 12 months through Sea Change.</p>
</text>
